   "q": "<p>Cumhuriyetin ilk yıllarında <b>ekonomi</b> alanında yaşanan gelişmeler aşağıdaki şemada verilmiştir.</p>\n<div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 136\" width=\"560\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"1927 Teşvik-i Sanayi Kanunu'ndan 1934 Birinci Beş Yıllık Sanayi Planı'na geçiş\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"560\" height=\"136\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/>\n<defs><marker id=\"ekA\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#475569\"/></marker></defs>\n<g font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n<rect x=\"6\" y=\"6\" width=\"164\" height=\"124\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#eff6ff\" stroke=\"#2563eb\"/>\n<text x=\"88\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e40af\">1927</text>\n<text x=\"88\" y=\"43\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e40af\">Teşvik-i Sanayi Kanunu</text>\n<text x=\"88\" y=\"66\">Fabrika açan özel</text>\n<text x=\"88\" y=\"82\">girişimciye vergi</text>\n<text x=\"88\" y=\"98\">muafiyeti ve ücretsiz</text>\n<text x=\"88\" y=\"114\">arsa sağlandı.</text>\n<line x1=\"172\" y1=\"68\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#ekA)\"/>\n<rect x=\"194\" y=\"6\" width=\"164\" height=\"124\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fef2f2\" stroke=\"#dc2626\"/>\n<text x=\"276\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#991b1b\">1929</text>\n<text x=\"276\" y=\"43\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#991b1b\">Sonuç alınamadı</text>\n<text x=\"276\" y=\"66\">Halkta yeterli sermaye</text>\n<text x=\"276\" y=\"82\">ve teknik bilgi yoktu.</text>\n<text x=\"276\" y=\"102\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#b91c1c\">1929 Dünya Ekonomik</text>\n<text x=\"276\" y=\"118\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#b91c1c\">Bunalımı patlak verdi.</text>\n<line x1=\"360\" y1=\"68\" x2=\"378\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#ekA)\"/>\n<rect x=\"382\" y=\"6\" width=\"172\" height=\"124\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dcfce7\" stroke=\"#16a34a\"/>\n<text x=\"468\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#166534\">1934</text>\n<text x=\"468\" y=\"43\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#166534\">I. Beş Yıllık Sanayi Planı</text>\n<text x=\"468\" y=\"66\">Büyük yatırımlar ve</text>\n<text x=\"468\" y=\"82\">fabrikalar devlet</text>\n<text x=\"468\" y=\"98\">eliyle kuruldu</text>\n<text x=\"468\" y=\"114\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#166534\">(Devletçilik).</text>\n</g>\n</svg></div>\n<p>Bu şemaya göre 1930’lu yıllarda <b>Devletçilik</b> ilkesinin benimsenmesinde aşağıdakilerden hangisi etkili olmuştur?</p>",
